        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Lawi 23:22; Kumb 24:19-22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Utakapovuna mavuno ya nchi yako, usivune kabisa hadi mpakani mwa shamba wala usirudi nyuma kukusanya mabaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msirudie kukusanya kila kitu katika shamba la mizabibu, wala usiokote zabibu zilizoanguka chini; utawaachia maskini na wageni. Mimi ndimi Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
